Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 03:10:42 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] TEST ONLY: relay mined blocks to peers, merkle branch,
 chipnet bits

Not for upstream. submitblocklight checks the solved block (tip, bits at
its own time, median time, block.check, BIP34 height) and relays it to
the connected peers instead of the unimplemented organize(block) (#563).
getblocktemplatelight gains the coinbase merkle branch, and its bits
follow the template's own time (chipnet 20-minute rule).
